      "Title": "ExecMagica.Engine.Card",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.Card.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Legacy Unity card view/runtime model.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.Card.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Important:</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.Card.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.Card.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">GameEngine must use CardInstance, not Card.</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.Card.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">CardDefinition describes immutable card data loaded from JSON.</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.Card.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">Card is kept temporarily because Unity UI, deck editor and prefabs still expect it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.Card.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"8\">Later this class should be reduced or replaced by a dedicated UnityCardViewModel.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/ExecMagica.Engine.CardDefinition.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/ExecMagica.Engine.CardDefinition.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "ExecMagica.Engine.CardDefinition",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.CardDefinition.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Immutable-like card definition loaded from JSON/database.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.CardDefinition.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">This class describes what a card is:\ntitle, stats, cost, effects, keywords, artwork path, collectibility.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.CardDefinition.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">It should not contain per-match runtime state such as:\nInstanceId, current zone, owner, CanAttack, IsPlaced, temporary damage counters.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/ExecMagica.Engine.CardEffect.yml",
