      "Title": "ExecMagica.Engine.CardInstance",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.CardInstance.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A card as it exists during a match — a concrete instance with its own id, current\nstats, combat flags and zone. Unlike <xref href=\"ExecMagica.Engine.CardDefinition\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, it carries per-match\nruntime state and lives inside a <xref href=\"ExecMagica.Engine.PlayerState\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> zone.</p>\n"
    },
