      "Title": "ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Represents one concrete game action.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Example:</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">PlayCard: source = card from hand, target = optional card or hero</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">AttackCard: source = attacking card, target = defending card</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">AttackHero: source = attacking card, target = enemy hero</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/ExecMagica.Engine.GameAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">EndTurn: source = 0, target = none</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
